      "statement": "Exact-hash Windows ipustack.sys 32.00.20101.3760 contains a secondary device-revision refinement mapping values 1..8 to Strix A/B, Krackan 1/2, Strix Halo, and Gorgon Point 1/2/3 display labels; it initializes unknown revision to 9 and contains a dedicated 0x117 command primitive. This independently correlates with upstream amdxdna MSG_OP_GET_DEV_REVISION semantics."
