      "firmwareRevisionSemantics": "Firmware-reported AIE2 device-revision values, not PCI REV_XX bytes. Linux upstream defines STXA=1, STXB=2, KRK1=3, KRK2=4, HALO=5, GPT1=6, GPT2=7, GPT3=8, UNKN=9 and enables AIE2_GET_DEV_REVISION from firmware 6.24. Exact-hash Windows ipustack.sys 32.00.20101.3760 independently contains the same 1..8 refinement order, unknown default 9, and a dedicated 0x117 command primitive.",
